{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>בעץ</b> Two times in the Masorah: here, ולא נותר כל ירק בעץ, and the other, ונערים בעץ כשלו. On account of the children whom he did not wish to send away, as he said, 'Is it the way of the little ones to slaughter?' — he failed בעץ, such that no green remained בעץ."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:25.800961473Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}